5. CADENCE - WHEN AND HOW OFTEN WE MEET

1. University and Campus Circuit. Frequency: monthly, one campus per month, rotating through the list in Section 4b. Typical day: Tuesday to Thursday. Typical time: 10:00 to 17:00. Duration: up to 3 days.
2. Event Center or Hotel Conferences. Frequency: quarterly, rotating region. Typical day: Saturday. Typical time: 09:00 to 18:00. Duration: 1 day.
3. Community Hub, In-person Meetup. Frequency: monthly, 1st Saturday of the month. Typical time: 14:00 to 18:00. Duration: half-day.
4. Community Hub, Virtual Meetup. Frequency: weekly, every Wednesday. Typical time: 19:00 to 20:30 CET. Duration: 90 minutes.
5. Community Hub, Walk-in Office Hours. Frequency: weekly, Monday to Friday. Typical time: 10:00 to 17:00. Open door.
6. Website Support Desk. Frequency: continuous, every day, 24 hours.

This is a default rhythm, and it'll flex around exam schedules, holidays, and whatever a campus actually needs.


