16. GET INVOLVED

Whether you're a student wondering about your first wallet, a shop owner curious what shielded payments would mean for your till, or someone who wants to become one of our certified local trainers, there's a door open somewhere in Belgium most weeks of the year.

1. Visit the Community Hub in Brussels.
2. Join a weekly virtual meetup, every Wednesday, 19:00 CET.
3. Catch the Campus Circuit when it reaches your city.
4. Pick up, or where funded, claim a free copy of, Zcash for Belgians.
5. Apply for the Level 4 Trainer track and bring this to your own city.
6. Explore the resource index and local forum on the Zcash Belgium website.

This plan will change as we go. That's the point of writing it down early, so we can keep improving it region by region, campus by campus.
